WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.420
Vanish, Cyberse!

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:31.870
The Knights of Hanoi are 
attacking the Cyberse!

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:35.780
But we're trapped, so we can't fight back!

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:37.890
What's that?

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:41.620
Thanks for waiting!  The savior has arrived!

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:44.840
Oh my!  You're all trapped?

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:48.390
Good thing I'm an outcast.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.600
Oh well!  I guess I'll save you!

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:53.530
Don't let him escape!

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.270
What are you going to do?

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.970
Here I go!

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:21.160
What?  He's cutting the signal?

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:25.880
He's going to hide this 
world from the outside?

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.640
But if he does, he can't come back!

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.430
Piece of cake!

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.260
Track him down.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:51.620
Only that Ignis knows the Cyberse's location!

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.600
Five Years Later...

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:35.420
Linkslayer attacks!

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.140
Meteor Slash!

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.940
Why do you oppose the Hanoi?

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.380
Who are you?

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:54.790
Wherever the Knights of Hanoi 
cause chaos, I'll be there.

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:59.020
My name is... Playmaker!

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:16.770
I run Across the universe

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:19.940
At the speed of light

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:21.810
Begin Loading

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:25.540
Open the door of dreams

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:29.110
VRAINS spreads

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:32.220
Believe in myself

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:35.750
VRAINS continues

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:41.060
The circuit draws the future

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:45.130
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:46.730
Access!

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:49.430
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.040
I'm now With the Wind

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.340
Link with my soul

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.110
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.840
Now Win the Race

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:00.680
Connected world

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:04.180
No matter when

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:07.550
Nothing is impossible

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:11.690
Strive for hope

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:16.260
And ride the wind!

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:42.600
You...  Wake up...

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.240
Whoa!  You're awake?

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:52.970
Fujiki, right?  Class is over.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.200
Who are you again?

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:59.740
Hey!  It's been a month since school started!

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:02.520
You still don't know your classmate's name?

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:05.450
You probably don't have many friends.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.890
Geez, thanks.

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.820
I'm Naoki Shima.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.770
Anything you want to say to me?

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:16.350
Not particularly.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.120
Even about this?

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:20.500
Oh, that.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:24.780
SOL Technologies's new Duel Disk.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.510
Oh, you noticed?

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:36.210
Your old-style Duel Disk 
requires you to insert cards.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:41.090
Mine is loaded with an AI 
that helps during my duels.

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:42.820
Hello.

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:45.200
Oh, hello.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:51.710
This AI is connected to SOL Technologies's 
cloud, so I can use cards in data form.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:57.170
I also have priority access to 
the VR network, LINK VRAINS.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:03.630
See?  Like this.

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:06.490
Ever go to LINK VRAINS?

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.080
Don't be stupid!

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.320
“Stupid” is a forbidden word.

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:14.540
It's a special gathering 
place for long-time duelists!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.500
Charisma Duelists go there too!

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.720
You can't go there as easy as you think!

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:20.790
I see.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.460
But if I do go, maybe I'll 
meet Charisma Duelists.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.580
Maybe even Playmaker!

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.900
Playmaker?

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:31.040
He's the hottest duelist right now.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:37.140
He secretly fights the Knights of Hanoi, 
hackers who commit crimes in LINK VRAINS.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.610
Do you have a picture of Playmaker?

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.850
Of course not.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:46.760
He's cool because no one knows his identity.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:51.240
I want to become a duelist 
of justice, like Playmaker!

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.280
Good luck.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:56.720
Want me to teach you how to duel?

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.260
No thanks.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.440
Three reasons why I don't 
think you're a strong duelist:

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:06.940
#1: You brag about an object because 
you don't care about your deck.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:12.680
#2: You haven't gone to LINK VRAINS 
because you don't trust your skills.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:19.920
#3: You don't look past the surface, 
so you can't be a good duelist.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.390
But you have three positives.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:30.380
#1: Even if it's about an object, you want to 
talk about dueling because you love Duel Monsters.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:35.870
#2: Being able to acquire the new Duel 
Disk quickly means you're well-informed.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:43.300
#3: Since you're willing to talk to a loner 
like me, that means you're also a loner.

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:44.850
So you're not a bad guy.

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:50.580
What's with this “three” stuff?

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:54.170
Whatever!  Go duel by yourself!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:58.410
Hmm, I never thought about that.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:02.530
Is there a three Main Monster Zone limit?

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.690
No, there isn't.

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:20.180
Gulp!  I've been found!

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:41.500
Zaizen, is it true that Ignis has appeared?

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.140
Yes, Bishop.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:47.750
He's definitely somewhere in the network.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:53.200
SOL Technologies is the long-time 
leader of the network.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:09:00.040
Thanks to the data material 
that the Cyberse created.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:04.620
But five years ago, due to Hanoi's attacks...

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:08.990
...the AI known as Ignis hid the 
Cyberse somewhere in the network.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:14.060
Due to Cyberse's disappearance, 
data material has decreased.

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:18.240
Network efficiency has decreased by over 30%.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:24.620
If we don't find the Cyberse, the 
network will fall further into chaos.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:29.550
If that happens, the fate 
of our company is obvious.

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:35.220
We must do whatever it takes to find that 
Ignis and learn the location of the Cyberse.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.160
Understood.

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:56.220
Revolver, we found a lead on Ignis.

00:09:56.510 --> 00:10:01.350
If SOL Technologies captures Ignis, 
the Cyberse will resurrect.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:05.110
If that happens, our 
efforts will go to waste.

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:08.320
We must find him before SOL Technologies.

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.860
There's one other concern.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:14.290
The one known as Playmaker.  
He will interfere.

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:17.200
Is he SOL Technologies's assassin?

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:21.040
No.  They'd be more public about it.

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:24.250
He blocks us when we try to track him.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:27.810
And he erases all his LINK VRAINS logins.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:31.010
He must be an expert hacker.

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:34.230
He concerns me, but ignore him for now.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.810
Our priority is to find Ignis.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:45.420
Who are they again?

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.710
Charisma Duelists Go Onizuka and Blue Angel.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.400
Charisma Duelists...

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:55.130
Hey, have you heard of the Data Storm?

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:56.560
No.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:02.120
Long ago, a wind known as the Data 
Storm blew through LINK VRAINS.

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:06.240
A group used to Speed Duel there.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:08.650
Speed Duel...

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:15.520
Rumors say that never-before-seen monsters 
lived in a new world inside the wind.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:20.640
But that wind is now gone.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:27.880
If you ever find it, maybe 
you'll enjoy dueling again.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:32.760
I feel bad that I got you involved, Yusaku.

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:35.420
I'm doing this of my own free will.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:41.080
I promise to get revenge on those who 
took your younger brother and my past!

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:47.260
Anyway, have there been any changes?

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:51.120
Den City's network security 
has been strengthened.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.990
It seems SOL Technologies 
is looking for something.

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:56.590
For what?

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:59.570
I heard it's an AI program.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:03.140
I never heard of a program that can flee.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:06.040
It's not like it has free will, like a human.

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:10.240
They might use a large-scale scan to find it.

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:13.320
If they do, Hanoi will also come for it.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:15.950
Wait a sec.

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:19.450
Why do you oppose the Hanoi?

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:22.220
I see.  I get it!

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.980
Kusanagi!  Let's get busy!

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:28.900
True.  Even my shop gets busy at night.

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:29.980
That's not what I mean!

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:33.260
Hey!  I have to prepare the 
ingredients for tonight!

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:37.420
Build a trap.  I'll use it to capture the AI.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:43.400
Not just SOL Technologies.  The 
Knights of Hanoi are after it too.

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:47.480
If I capture the AI, it'll be 
my secret weapon against Hanoi.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.480
Are you for real?

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:53.450
Even SOL Technologies and Hanoi 
have failed to capture it.

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:58.040
To be precise, I'm not capturing it.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.660
I'm creating an escape route.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:02.560
The large-scale scan is the perfect chance.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:05.050
Because it'll have nowhere to hide.

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:10.280
At that moment, we'll create 
a hole in the firewall.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.860
Into here.

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:14.310
It's impossible.  There's not enough time.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:17.810
We can if we work together.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.040
Okay!

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:32.420
Is the scan ready yet?

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:34.360
It's ready to go.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.090
Then why hasn't it been implemented yet?

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:40.830
During the scan, the city's 
security level will decrease.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:46.300
If the Knights of Hanoi attack during 
that time, there will be enormous damage.

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:51.360
But is there any other way to find Ignis?

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:52.800
No.

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:02.240
Everyone!  Are you fired up?

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:08.570
Many Charisma Duelists are 
about to duel in LINK VRAINS!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:17.280
Dueling in Area #1 is LINK VRAINS's #1 
hooligan who uses the Gouki Deck, Go Onizuka!

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:28.730
Dueling in Area #2 is LINK VRAINS's poster 
girl who uses a Trickster Deck, Blue Angel!

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:33.950
To all who have access, come to LINK VRAINS!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:39.320
And for those already here, 
pay attention to the screen!

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:43.110
Good luck, Go!  Blue Angel!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.200
I don't know which one to watch!

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:51.670
MSD Version 99671, new update complete!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:56.800
Estimated completion in 3657 seconds.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:58.610
Activating scan program!

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:11.720
This is bad!  I won't be able to escape!

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:19.730
Hurry!  SOL Technologies's scan has started!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:24.470
Den City's security level 
has begun to decrease.

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:28.210
I was waiting for this moment.

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:32.680
Revolver, did you call for me?

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:36.030
He will flee into LINK VRAINS.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:39.260
Do whatever it takes to capture the Ignis.

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:40.320
Roger.

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:50.000
IPA078388, invader in the system!

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:53.920
The firewall is being breached!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.360
What's going on?

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.580
What what what?

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.900
This program is the Knights of Hanoi!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.280
They've arrived!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.250
What's this sensation?

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:19.020
What?

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:22.690
That's...

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.640
Where's Ignis?

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:29.000
I'll crush anyone who gets in my way!

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:36.370
Run!

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:46.120
Hanoi's attack has started!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.090
It'll be over soon.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:53.100
If I acquire the AI, it'll be our savior.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:54.930
Can you really capture it?

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:59.340
Yeah.  I feel its presence.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:11.310
Found you, Ignis!

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:15.740
Where's an escape route?  Where?

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:17.510
It's complete.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:21.490
There's one!

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:24.560
LINK VRAINS accounts are being erased!

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.020
Can't you purge the Hanoi?

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.730
I can't!  LINK VRAINS will be destroyed!

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.370
Come to me!

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:03.890
Welcome.  You're going to be our savior.

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.630
Huh?  What?

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:10.790
You can't change the program 
from within the Duel Disk.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.160
What?  I'm captured?

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:16.110
You must be the AI that everyone is after.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.350
No, I'm just an ordinary AI!

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:29.160
There's no time.  Let's go!

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:31.040
Go where?

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.290
To LINK VRAINS!

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:35.190
But I just escaped from there!

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:38.030
I didn't ask for your opinion!

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:43.670
Deck set!  Into the VRAINS!

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.490
Vanish!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.910
Sigh...  I'm really back.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.380
Who are you?

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:29.350
Who are you?

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:31.820
My name is Playmaker!

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:35.100
I have what you're looking for.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.620
Stop attacking LINK VRAINS.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:41.900
If you don't, I'll erase it right now!

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.620
Hey hey hey!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:46.500
Don't treat your savior as a hostage!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:50.060
I converted this program into a duel program.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:53.910
If you want it, you have 
to defeat me in a duel.

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:58.410
That's Ignis!

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.380
That's where Ignis is!

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:08.320
Fine.  You'll learn what happens 
when you oppose the Hanoi!

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:10.260
I'm looking forward to it.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.300
No way!

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.830
Playmaker has appeared!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.800
This isn't good.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.640
His dragon is strong.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.970
You can't win with your current deck.

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:30.660
Oh really?

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.790
If I lose, you'll fall into Hanoi's hands.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.410
You should pray that I win.

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:38.650
AIs don't pray.

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:41.050
We only calculate how to win!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:51.230
Release Cyberse's data material!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.310
What's happening?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.830
What's this?

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.090
Jump on, Playmaker!

00:21:37.260 --> 00:21:38.280
This is...

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:44.950
A Data Storm?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.080
Seize the wind, Playmaker!

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:02.200
Here we go!  Speed Duel!

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:27.250
Dance!  Strike with your heels

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:30.790
Scream!  You Gotta Go  Raise your voice

00:22:31.210 --> 00:22:34.390
Sing!  Unleash your existence

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:38.430
Get Away!  Until you surpass your limits

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:42.360
Try It over and over

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:50.510
In this world that spreads forever

00:22:50.860 --> 00:22:57.450
The timeline flows forever

00:22:57.740 --> 00:22:59.980
Nothing is certain

00:23:00.140 --> 00:23:01.690
In these isolated times

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:03.420
Set Yourself Free without hesitation

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:05.190
Cuz We Still Believin' Magic

00:23:05.450 --> 00:23:08.590
The traces we leave behind

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:12.160
The traces we leave behind

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:16.130
The miracles we create

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:18.370
Never Give Up Never!

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:22.210
I won't give up  Never Give Up Never!

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:37.830
LINK VRAINS.

00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:41.730
That's where people used to 
duel while riding the wind.

00:23:42.160 --> 00:23:48.480
Duelists searched for never-before-seen 
monsters that lived inside the wind.

00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:55.150
But the wind vanished, and people 
gradually forgot about it.

00:23:55.150 --> 00:23:57.550
I already know about Speed Duels?

00:23:57.990 --> 00:24:03.200
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Seize the Wind!  Storm Access

00:24:03.200 --> 00:24:05.320
Into the VRAINS!
